  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "TecsackSoftwaredeliversprojectsthroughastructuredbutflexiblemethodologybuiltaround\nfourphases:Discovery,IntegrationDesign,IncrementalDelivery,andResponsibleRollout.The\nsamemethodologyapplieswhethertheengagementisaplatformbuild,anAI/RAGintegration,\nor a modernization project — only the specifics of each phase change with the project's scope.",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "Table of Contents",
      "1. Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Theapproachisdesignedaroundoneprinciple:shipaworkingcapabilityagainstrealdataearly,\nthen iterate — rather than a long build cycle before anything is usable by the client.",
